---
/** PullQuote (DESIGN-SPEC 5.8 item 8): Fraunces italic Imperial, hung Saffron “, 1px Sapphire rule. One per 1,000 words at most. */
---
<blockquote class="pull" data-reveal><p class="t-pull pull__text"><slot /></p></blockquote>
<style>
  .pull {
    position: relative;
    margin-block: var(--s-8);
    padding: var(--s-1) 0 var(--s-1) var(--s-6);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--c-line);
  }
  .pull__text { margin: 0; color: var(--c-heading); font-variant-numeric: lining-nums; max-width: 26em; }
  .pull__text::before {
    content: "\201C";
    position: absolute; left: calc(var(--s-6) - 0.42em); top: var(--s-1);
    color: var(--kk-saffron);
    font-style: normal; font-weight: 400;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0.5px var(--kk-ink);   /* Ink edge for Saffron on light (graft 10) */
  }
  :global(.prose) .pull__text { font-size: var(--fs-pull); line-height: var(--lh-pull); }
</style>
